Well, in that case, let's not keep our guests waiting. Up next is our penultimate piece. Enjoy!

377
00:48:07,203 --> 00:48:09,183
Light the floodlights, let's begin.

378
00:48:09,183 --> 00:48:11,903
We'll start stage right and shuffle on in.

379
00:48:12,083 --> 00:48:13,983
(It's time for Myth, ready to steal the show!)

380
00:48:13,983 --> 00:48:16,213
(We're jumping with joy, let's go!)

381
00:48:16,213 --> 00:48:21,903
Curtain's up, so cue the band, we'll keep on entertaining, hand in hand.

382
00:48:24,863 --> 00:48:29,693
It's our greatest moment yet, a spectacle they'll never forget!

383
00:48:29,693 --> 00:48:32,553
(We're all aglow, party from dusk to dawn, the show will go on and on!)

384
00:48:33,353 --> 00:48:39,883
Tell them that we're here to stay and spread the news from Tokyo to Broadway!

385
00:48:42,373 --> 00:48:46,273
Gleaming (Ooh!) spotlight (Ah!) Get the gang together, we're boogieing all night!

386
00:48:46,273 --> 00:48:50,873
Beaming (Ooh!) so bright (Ah!) Now we're feeling all right!

387
00:48:51,173 --> 00:48:58,353
Since the day we met, we've all been going strong (It's been so long, ooh!) And we'll keep moving right along!

388
00:48:59,103 --> 00:49:04,213
So keep on dancing, yeah, you bet ain't nothing gonna stop us, we're a perfect quintet!

389
00:49:04,213 --> 00:49:07,893
(In harmony no matter where we go, it's meant to be, don't you know?)

390
00:49:08,273 --> 00:49:14,353
We're gonna feel so alive when it's us five, ready to put on another show!

391
00:49:34,273 --> 00:49:40,303
There's a ton to celebrate, the mood is fun and we're feeling great!

392
00:49:43,273 --> 00:49:49,103
From the rafters to the aisles contagious laughter and our biggest smiles!

393
00:49:56,983 --> 00:49:59,972
We'll slay 'em like we always do, make no bones about it!

394
00:50:00,080 --> 00:50:02,180
We'll slay 'em like we always do, make no bones about it!

395
00:50:00,980 --> 00:50:05,180
When I'm with you, it's divine, it's exquisite.

396
00:50:05,680 --> 00:50:09,580
On land or in water, we've never been hotter; it feels sublime.

397
00:50:10,030 --> 00:50:12,830
We're friends for all time!

398
00:50:13,280 --> 00:50:17,630
(Come on, listen to the Tentacult and jive with me, gonna shake your feathers here with KFP.)

399
00:50:18,080 --> 00:50:22,330
(Deadbeats keeping rhythm while the Teamates spin, the Chumbuds join right in!)
(Deadbeats keeping rhythm while the Teammates spin, the Chumbuds join right in!)

400
00:50:22,730 --> 00:50:26,230
We're like a work of art, and I'm gonna keep you in my heart.

401
00:50:26,580 --> 00:50:31,030
We'll stick together,

402
00:50:31,080 --> 00:50:37,580
Myth forever!

403
00:50:40,030 --> 00:50:43,130
Symphony of sight and sound, turning like a merry-go-round,

404
00:50:43,180 --> 00:50:46,030
(We can get 'em cheering even more!) On and on and encore!

405
00:50:46,180 --> 00:50:51,130
Dream another dream with me, now it's time to change the key!

406
00:50:54,180 --> 00:50:59,130
Light the floodlights, keep 'em lit, tonight's our night, and we've got a hit!

407
00:51:02,880 --> 00:51:08,580
Get in line beside me now, it's almost time to take another bow!

408
00:51:09,180 --> 00:51:12,830
We'll stay on track, you know that I've got your back! (I say,)

409
00:51:12,830 --> 00:51:16,930
Get on the dance floor! (Okay!) Hear the applause roar (Each day,)

410
00:51:17,080 --> 00:51:20,080
The music will go on and on, and encore!

411
00:51:20,180 --> 00:51:29,930
(Old friends, wherever you go, New gens, no ends, I'm gonna follow) The music will go on and on, an endless show!

412
00:51:55,680 --> 00:52:01,880
My legs are getting so tired!

413
00:52:01,880 --> 00:52:05,580
Oh, that was fun. That was a good time.

414
00:52:05,880 --> 00:52:12,080
You guys just listened to Myth's new song, "The Show Goes On!". What did you think?

415
00:52:12,280 --> 00:52:15,580
Alright! Yeah, Broadway!

416
00:52:15,680 --> 00:52:18,880
We figured we would stick with the Broadway theme and make it something like...

417
00:52:18,880 --> 00:52:26,580
You know, musical, something that would make everyone on their feet and dancing.

418
00:52:26,880 --> 00:52:29,580
Yes, yes. It's so good.

419
00:52:29,580 --> 00:52:35,580
So genki! Yes! Fun! And the title truly encapsulates what we feel.

420
00:52:35,580 --> 00:52:42,580
We really want the fun to last forever, and to make that happen, all of us in Myth are going to do the best we can, and...

421
00:52:42,580 --> 00:52:54,580
those are the feelings that were packed, yeah, nicely into this new song. Hope you guys will listen to it a lot because...

422
00:52:54,580 --> 00:53:03,580
it will be on the streaming platforms very soon. So get ready to wear out your speakers!

423
00:53:03,580 --> 00:53:10,580
And also the MV is going to be right after this, we're going right into it, be ready!

424
00:53:10,580 --> 00:53:22,580
But that's not all! Maybe another little surprise... we have merchandise coming out!

425
00:53:22,580 --> 00:53:31,080
Exactly! Now, we will not show it right now, but it will be shown at the very end of the stream, at the ending screen, so stay tuned for that!

426
00:53:31,080 --> 00:53:37,080
Don't you dare leave the stream, okay? So we don't have much time left...

427
00:53:37,080 --> 00:53:46,580
I thought I'd like to hear what you ladies are currently feeling. Who wants to go first?

428
00:53:46,580 --> 00:53:55,580
Shark! Gura split out of nowhere, I guess. I guess she can do that, but whatever!

429
00:53:55,580 --> 00:54:04,580
It's show time, baby! Amelia was really good! That was really good! We got into it! Thank you so much!

430
00:54:04,580 --> 00:54:10,580
Who else? Who else? Maybe you, Ina?

431
00:54:10,580 --> 00:54:22,580
Well, you know, it kind of reminded me of when Myth started together in the past and with the journey of a thousand years, and now with all these performances into the future...

432
00:54:22,580 --> 00:54:36,580
You can't live in the past, eggheads! Stop the eggheads! We're playing around too much. Good segue, Ina.

433
00:54:36,580 --> 00:54:59,080
Oh me? Oh gosh. Well, I don't know, guys. I feel like... I just feel like we've been through so much together and... and I'm so happy to be by your side.

434
00:55:00,653 --> 00:55:01,913
Give me, give me, give me something wholesome. Come on.

435
00:55:02,253 --> 00:55:07,813
Fine, fine, fine, fine. I love singing songs that I love with people that I love, that's it. That's all there is to it.

436
00:55:08,013 --> 00:55:14,743
I love performing with you guys. You guys are the best. And, yeah, before it gets too sappy, somebody else take the mic. I think everybody...

437
00:55:15,203 --> 00:55:18,263
What did you think? What did you think?

438
00:55:18,263 --> 00:55:29,893
Yeah, so today I did a little bit of MCing here, uh, but, well, uh, but for me, you know, I realize when we joined, our oldest senpais, I think we're around like four years, right?

439
00:55:29,893 --> 00:55:39,283
Years entered the game and now we're four years in. We're old. We're like really proper senpais now.

440
00:55:39,283 --> 00:55:57,353
And everybody, you got to respect us, pay the senpai tax. Pay up. Yeah. So, all of these four years, hopefully more, and, you know, I want to make more memories. This was definitely a big, nice memory. So the show must go on. The show goes on indeed, just like the title. We're going to do our best. So, please support us, listen to the new song.

441
00:55:57,633 --> 00:56:08,663
And who's that? What's that? I think we can gather together. All right! Together! Huddle, huddle, huddle, huddle, huddle, huddle! You guys ready? Here we go. All right.

442
00:56:10,003 --> 00:56:18,863
Mori Calliope! Takanashi Kiara! Ninomae Ina'nis! Gawr Gura! Watson Amelia! Together! We're Myth!

443
00:56:33,238 --> 00:56:40,038
We're ready to greet the world! We're voyaging forward with courage to run toward a brand-new start.

444
00:56:40,038 --> 00:56:46,098
Let's go live! Bridging the distance across the sea endlessly,

445
00:56:46,098 --> 00:56:51,768
Cheerfully meeting heart-to-heart!

446
00:56:53,138 --> 00:56:59,698
[Title: Connect the World]

