00:57:38,298 --> 00:57:44,908
We're ready to change the game, a shimmering showcase, creating a new place where we can shine!

454
00:57:44,908 --> 00:57:51,138
Day by day (yeah!), sparkling stories will intertwine.

455
00:57:51,138 --> 00:57:56,988
Get ready to cross the waves, we're voyaging forward with courage to run toward a brand-new stage.

456
00:57:56,988 --> 00:58:03,588
Let's go live! (Yeah!) Bridging the distance across the sea endlessly,

457
00:58:03,588 --> 00:58:09,998
Follow me and we'll turn the page!

458
00:58:09,998 --> 00:58:18,998
Breaking through the doubt, we know we'll figure out a way to clear each towering trial.

459
00:58:19,098 --> 00:58:26,998
Sharing all our hopes, we can conquer any challenge with a smile!

460
00:58:27,198 --> 00:58:33,398
We'll link our hearts as we search across the globe, knowing,

461
00:58:33,398 --> 00:58:39,198
