462
00:58:53,098 --> 00:58:59,698
I wanna chase a wish unwaveringly, playing out a grand story.

463
00:58:59,698 --> 00:59:06,698
Share the futures that we can see, making them reality!

464
00:59:06,698 --> 00:59:14,698
Take my hand and reach for the screen, all we need are glittering dreams.

465
00:59:14,698 --> 00:59:18,998
Our hearts and souls all fulfilled in the world we build!

466
00:59:18,998 --> 00:59:24,998
We're ready to seize the day, traversing the pathways, discovering highways to everywhere!

467
00:59:24,998 --> 00:59:30,298
Step by step (yeah!), gathering stories that we can share!

468
00:59:30,298 --> 00:59:36,598
Get ready to lead the way, with each generation, a shining sensation, a dream unfurls.

469
00:59:36,598 --> 00:59:43,798
Let's make friends (yeah!), making a moment of history, joyfully! Follow me,

470
